		(property "Function" "Provides Tag-Connect pads for SWD programming (pad 1 VTref +3V3_D, 2 SWDIO, 3 NRST, 4 SWCLK, 5 GND); no connector is fitted. Pad 6 (SWO) is not connected (S-18): trace output uses SEGGER RTT over SWD or the USB-CDC console, and U8 PB3 is left analog. Keep pogo pads, alignment holes and cable access clear, with ground and target-voltage reference connected."
