		(property "Function" "Forms the lower buck feedback resistor (RFBB) with R16: 23.2k/10k -> 3.320 V, RFBT||RFBB 6.99 kOhm (P1-23). Keep the FB junction compact and return it to the quiet local U6 ground region. Layout: lower FB divider arm in the northern FB cluster beside C41/R16 (FB pad 4.4 mm from SW, 0.36 mm from C41.1), GND pad with its own via, never on the SW/BOOT side (R50). First power-up current-limited; abort if TP11 > 3.6 V (a feedback-detect misread would drive +3V3_D toward VSYS)."
			(at 0 0 0)
			(layer "F.Fab")
