		(property "Function" "EXP_INT1_N 10k pull-up to +3V3_EXP on the J11 side of RN401 element 1 (P1-26 / EXP-06): defined idle level for an open-drain shield interrupt; on the switched shield rail, so an unpowered shield is never back-powered. Firmware: keep PD10 analog or EXTI10 masked until +3V3_EXP is on and settled, mask again before switching it off; never enable the PD10 internal pull-up while the rail is off. B.Cu beside RN401 pin 8, via-in-pad to +3V3_EXP."
			(at 0 0 0)
			(layer "B.SilkS")
			(hide yes)
